(text "POWER. One 12 V input, two fuses. NOT FOR FABRICATION.\\n+12V_MCU feeds the 3.3 V buck only. +12V_COIL feeds the external switch, the ignition contact and the two Finder coils.\\nThere is no 5 V logic rail. The CAN isolator makes its own 5 V from 3.3 V, and only when the publish jumper is fitted.\\nContactor-coil current does not enter this 12 V input. It flows through the relay contacts from the boat's existing control feed." (at 20 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "12d1378a-6868-4ccc-8ac7-4120f7a158e7"))
