(text "SMAJ18A is a 400 W, 10/1000 us clamp, about 29.2 V at the rated pulse. It is not load-dump protection.\\nAP63203 absolute maximum is 35 V DC and 40 V for 400 ms. Recommended operating maximum is 32 V.\\nReverse battery turns Q_MCU off. The unidirectional TVS then conducts and F_MCU is what opens.\\nF_COIL is 250 mA, Littelfuse 0466.250. One Finder coil is 42 mA. The coil switches current-limit at 0.7 A minimum and then shut off, and this fuse opens on that current.\\nF_COIL is not the contactor fuse. Quick's 2.5 A fast control fuse stays in the boat's existing control wiring." (at 200 120 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "006e37c0-7ea8-428b-8064-c0379b52b254"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
)
